  "prefLabel": "Agr 1705.04 Rabies Vaccination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1705.04 Rabies Vaccination. Animals shall not be allowed to freely roam the facility unless they are currently immunized against rabies pursuant to RSA 436:100 and are free of visual evidence of communicable disease.\n\nSource. #14164, eff 12-31-24 (formerly Agr 1704.09)",
